note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/apish-fp8xb.om: the xbf16 comparisons of CUDApp tests/api_shells_diff.c, for av_fp8xb
note (gpu/nvidia/om/apiviews/fp8xb.om), which the test reaches as omega_fp8_pack_x_bf16. x is the test's
note 0x3f80 + i. Composed before apish-lib.om.
text t_name "APISH-FP8XB"
text l_xbf16 "xbf16"
fn aprun to void
x = new ushort 32 0
for i ulong 32
put x i ushort add 0x3f80 i
end
y = new f32 32 0.0f32
if ne av_fp8xb part x 0 32 part y 0 32 0
ckbad
end
for i ulong 32
as3 l_xbf16 ulong bitcast uint get y i
end
end
